flowchart TD
  M[1–3 Mission and orientation] --> GP[4–24 Guided case: WS-14 wrong default printer]
  GP --> C[25–26 Independent case: LP-07 stalled behind J-883]
  C --> P[27 Choose priority from matrix]
  P --> KB[28 Select relevant article]
  KB --> ACT[29 Select and execute action]
  ACT --> V[Increment action version; clear old verification and closure]
  V --> OK{Queue-specific action approved?}
  OK -->|Yes| REP[30 Fresh test and Dana confirmation available]
  OK -->|No| WRONG[No successful confirmation; factual consequence]
  REP --> VERIFY[Learner inspects reply; verify current version]
  WRONG --> DOC[31–32 Structured evidence, work, verification and owner]
  VERIFY --> DOC
  DOC --> STATUS[33 Save actual status]
  STATUS --> SUB[34 Review all fields and submit once]
  SUB --> SCORE[Freeze snapshot and five 20-point criteria]
  SCORE --> G{80 or more AND approved action AND fresh verification before Resolved?}
  G -->|Yes| PASS[35 Pass]
  G -->|No| FAIL[36 Work remains]
  PASS --> R[37–40 Criterion-specific read-only review]
  FAIL --> R
  R --> T[41 Checklist and transfer]
  T -->|Retry resets every challenge field| C
